research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log:244967:+          "quote": "Throughout, $\\mathbb{R}$ is the complete ordered field\n([[def-complete-ordered-field]], [[def-ordered-field]]) with its order\n([[def-real-order]]).\n\nA subset $I \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}$ is **order-convex** when",
