research/audit/wave4-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log:402590:+          "quote": "Let $F$ be a complete ordered field ([[def-complete-ordered-field]]) and let\n$\\varepsilon \\in F$ with $\\varepsilon > 0$. Then there is a natural number\n$n \\ge 1$ such that\n\n$$\\frac{1}{n \\cdot 1_F} < \\varepsilon ,$$",
