 17203	          "quote": "The set of **natural numbers** is the **smallest inductive set**\n([[def-inductive-set]]),\n\n$$\\mathbb{N} = \\omega := \\bigcap\\,\\{\\, I : I \\text{ is inductive} \\,\\},$$",
